%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d56cce9b854dbe4eb4d220d3699184f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Plot_C0_S2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Client::PlotConfig
  chapterId: 0
  sceneId: 2
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    text: Welcome back. This time, I've just deployed another Tanker from your side
      into the fray. Coordinate your actions.
    tutorialTargetId: OwnedReadyBar
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Now, call that big Tanker up here.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_Unit2
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Move him to this position!
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 1}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: 
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 3
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Click Paladin again!
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_Unit2
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 6
    text: Preparing to swing the heavy axe. Left click the Weapon Skill!
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Strike at the empty space behind the target! Trust me!
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 1, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: 
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: See the aura? But nothing happened yet. Let's inspect the skill to understand
      why.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Click on the Tanker on the map to select him again.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 1}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 2
    text: Right-click the Weapon Skill to inspect it.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: Look closely at the Skill Type. That slash was a 'Delayed' (Non-Instant)
      attack.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_STYPE
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: The heavy weapon is too massive. He is currently channeling his energy;
      the blow will land later.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Close the inspect panel.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_CancelButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Press "Wait" and watch the slash come down.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_WaitButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 5
    text: That concludes the second lesson.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S2_END
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
